      "writtenOn": "2024-01-02T20:10:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m surprised this works (or does it?) since the 8-stop gradient shader assumed trailing unused stops are equal to the last stop:\nhttps://crsrc.org/c/third_party/skia/src/sksl/sksl_graphite_frag.sksl;l\u003d491;drc\u003d4f218069",
